   "texts": [
    {
     "t0": 0.0,
     "label": "21 November 2026",
     "title": "Welcome to Guiding Lights",
     "t1": 7.2
    }
   ],
   "from": 354
  },
  {
   "kind": "clip",
   "dur": 13.25,
   "src": "film/breeze.mp4",
   "name": "Capt(IN) KM Breeze Antony",
   "role": "President, SSKZM OBA",
   "alum": false,
   "caps": [
    {
     "t0": 0.45,
     "t1": 3.45,
     "text": "I leave you with this thought."
    },
    {
     "t0": 3.45,
     "t1": 7.55,
     "text": "Think: will somebody celebrate us"
    },
    {
     "t0": 7.55,
     "t1": 9.45,
     "text": "as educators and teachers"
    },
    {
     "t0": 9.45,
     "t1": 13.1,
     "text": "long after we are gone?"
    }
   ],
   "from": 570
  },
  {
   "kind": "inter",
   "dur": 7.6,
   "photos": [
    {
     "at": 0.0,
     "dur": 4.7,
     "srcs": [
      "film/ph/6245.jpg"
     ],
     "zin": true,
     "land": true
    },
    {
     "at": 4.0,
     "dur": 3.6,
     "srcs": [
      "film/ph/6020.jpg",
      "film/ph/6072.jpg",
      "film/ph/6109.jpg",
      "film/ph/6159.jpg"
     ],
     "zin": false,
     "land": false
    }
   ],
   "texts": [
    {
     "t0": 0.0,
     "label": "Panel Discussion",
     "title": "When Answers Are Everywhere, What Should Schools Teach?",
     "t1": 7.6
    }
   ],
   "from": 968
  },
  {
   "kind": "clip",
   "dur": 13.25,
   "src": "film/kamal.mp4",
   "name": "Kamal Krishnan PS",
   "role": "Moderator, Panel Discussion",
   "alum": true,
   "caps": [
    {
     "t0": 0.35,
     "t1": 3.9,
     "text": "Imagine if a student gets up and asks:"
    },
    {
     "t0": 3.9,
     "t1": 6.15,
     "text": "do we know what we are actually throwing away?"
    },
    {
     "t0": 5.55,
     "t1": 7.7,
     "text": "Precisely these were the questions"
    },
    {
     "t0": 7.7,
     "t1": 11.05,
     "text": "that NBN Sir taught us to ask,"
    },
    {
     "t0": 11.05,
     "t1": 13.1,
     "text": "not just in class, in our lives too."
    }
   ],
   "from": 1196
  },
  {
   "kind": "clip",
   "dur": 18.5,
   "src": "film/vasuki.mp4",
   "name": "Dr K Vasuki IAS",
   "role": "Secretary to the Governor of Keralam",
   "alum": false,
   "caps": [
    {
     "t0": 0.4,
     "t1": 2.6,
     "text": "And there is a very subtle difference"
    },
    {
     "t0": 2.6,
     "t1": 6.0,
     "text": "between facts and truth,"
    },
    {
     "t0": 6.0,
     "t1": 7.6,
     "text": "and there's a very subtle difference"
    },
    {
     "t0": 7.6,
     "t1": 10.9,
     "text": "between knowledge and wisdom."
    },
    {
     "t0": 10.35,
     "t1": 13.95,
     "text": "I think education should be focused on creating"
    },
    {
     "t0": 13.95,
     "t1": 18.35,
     "text": "happy, compassionate, loving, peaceful human beings."
    }
   ],
   "from": 1593
  },
  {
   "kind": "clip",
   "dur": 19.5,
   "src": "film/jancy.mp4",
   "name": "Prof Dr Jancy James",
   "role": "Founder Vice Chancellor, Central University of Kerala",
   "alum": false,
   "caps": [
    {
     "t0": 0.4,
     "t1": 4.4,
     "text": "Don't teach a student, but discover the student."
    },
    {
     "t0": 4.4,
     "t1": 6.95,
     "text": "Discover those beautiful minds before you."
    },
    {
     "t0": 6.4,
     "t1": 10.1,
     "text": "Teaching or learning is not filling up a bucket"
    },
    {
     "t0": 10.1,
     "t1": 12.2,
     "text": "with information or knowledge."
    },
    {
     "t0": 12.2,
     "t1": 14.7,
     "text": "It's the kindling of a fire."
    },
    {
     "t0": 14.7,
     "t1": 16.8,
     "text": "It's the lighting up of a fire"
    },
    {
     "t0": 16.8,
     "t1": 19.35,
     "text": "in the personality of every child."
    }
   ],
   "from": 2148
  },
  {
   "kind": "clip",
   "dur": 15.45,
   "src": "film/john.mp4",
   "name": "Dr TR John",
   "role": "Chief of Medical Services, Aster Medcity, Kochi",
   "alum": true,
   "caps": [
    {
     "t0": 0.4,
     "t1": 2.15,
     "text": "Nowadays when I talk, I talk about"
    },
    {
     "t0": 2.15,
     "t1": 6.0,
     "text": "the silicon skills and the carbon capacity."
    },
    {
     "t0": 6.0,
     "t1": 10.3,
     "text": "The silicon capacity is what the AI can give you, or assist you,"
    },
    {
     "t0": 10.3,
     "t1": 12.7,
     "text": "and the carbon skills only a teacher can."
    },
    {
     "t0": 12.7,
     "t1": 15.3,
     "text": "Someone who is made of carbon can teach you."
    }
   ],
   "from": 2733
  },
  {
   "kind": "clip",
   "dur": 16.65,
   "src": "film/abhilash.mp4",
   "name": "Shri R Abhilash",
   "role": "Innovator; founder, Bloom and Fest",
   "alum": false,
   "caps": [
    {
     "t0": 0.35,
     "t1": 3.4,
     "text": "For me, education"
    },
    {
     "t0": 2.85,
     "t1": 5.95,
     "text": "is not about a truckload of information."
    },
    {
     "t0": 5.95,
     "t1": 7.95,
     "text": "It is about a capsule of inspiration."
    },
    {
     "t0": 7.95,
     "t1": 10.85,
     "text": "Can we be that inspiration to our children"
    },
    {
     "t0": 10.85,
     "t1": 13.25,
     "text": "and make them feel this space belongs to you"
    },
    {
     "t0": 13.25,
     "t1": 14.45,
     "text": "and belongs to us?"
    },
    {
     "t0": 14.45,
     "t1": 16.5,
     "text": "And that's very important."
    }
   ],
   "from": 3196
  },
  {
   "kind": "inter",
   "dur": 6.4,
   "photos": [
    {
     "at": 0.0,
     "dur": 4.3,
